					<article id="post-961" class="post post-961 type-post status-publish format-standard hentry category-news">
						
									
															<h1 class="entry-title fusion-post-title">SOL &#8211; Publication of Interim Results &#038; Lifting of Closed Period</h1>										<div class="post-content">
				<p>SOL has published its Interim Results for the period ended 30 June 2026.</p>
<p>The Company would like to advise “Affected Persons” that the closed period has been lifted.</p>
<div class="fusion-button-wrapper fusion-aligncenter"><a class="fusion-button button-flat fusion-button-default-size button-default fusion-button-default button-1 fusion-button-default-span fusion-button-default-type" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://www.secdex.net/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/SOL-Lifting-of-Closed-Period-and-Publication-of-Interim-Results-07082026.pdf"><span class="fusion-button-text awb-button__text awb-button__text--default">To view the full document, click here</span></a></div>
							</div>

												<div class="fusion-meta-info"><div class="fusion-meta-info-wrapper"><span class="vcard rich-snippet-hidden"><span class="fn"><a href="https://www.secdex.net/author/sysadmin/" rel="author">sysadmin</a></span></span><span class="updated rich-snippet-hidden">2026-08-07T15:28:37+01:00</span><span>August 7th, 2026</span><span class="fusion-inline-sep">|</span><a href="https://www.secdex.net/category/news/" rel="category tag">News</a><span class="fusion-inline-sep">|</span></div></div>													<div class="fusion-sharing-box fusion-theme-sharing-box fusion-single-sharing-box">
